          "text": "Abakuru b'ebika abandi orwo bagobire ahali Rwensinga omuli Yerusalemu bahonga ebihongo by'obweyendezi aha rw'okwombeka Rwensinga ya Ruhanga, bagigarura mbali eya mbere yabaire eli. ",
